    },
    {
      "start": 4,
      "end": 12.428,
      "speechEnd": 11.028,
      "label": "Welcome",
      "expression": "warm",
      "text": "Hello. It is good to meet you. Tell me a little about the thing you want to build, and the people who will use it."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.428,
      "end": 16.428,
      "speechEnd": 12.428,
      "label": "Considering the question",
      "expression": "thinking",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "start": 16.428,
      "end": 29.587,
      "speechEnd": 27.787,
      "label": "Explaining a decision",
      "expression": "focused",
      "text": "I would start by making the important task feel simple. We can test one useful flow, see where people get stuck, and use that feedback to decide what comes next."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.587,
      "end": 39.972,
      "speechEnd": 37.972,
      "label": "A lighter moment",
      "expression": "amused",
      "text": "And yes, sometimes the best feature is the button we decide to leave out. A little less can make the whole experience feel better."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.972,
      "end": 43.972,
      "speechEnd": 39.972,
      "label": "Listening again",
      "expression": "raised_eyebrow",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "start": 43.972,
      "end": 56.696,
      "speechEnd": 54.696,
      "label": "Reassurance",
      "expression": "warm",
      "text": "That is a fair concern. We do not need to get everything right on the first attempt. Let us understand the difficult part, try a small version, and learn from it."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.696,
      "end": 59.696,
      "speechEnd": 56.696,
      "label": "Thinking through a tradeoff",
      "expression": "thinking",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "start": 59.696,
      "end": 72.882,
      "speechEnd": 69.882,
      "label": "Wrapping up",
      "expression": "warm",
      "text": "I would be happy to walk through the options with you. We can keep the details clear, make the tradeoffs visible, and build something that feels right for your users."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.882,
      "end": 76.882,
      "speechEnd": 72.882,
      "label": "At rest",
      "expression": "neutral",
      "text": ""
    }
